<title>USA: Fortune to buy back shares from some holders.</title>
<headline>Fortune to buy back shares from some holders.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fortune Natural Resources Corp said Monday it is offering to buy back for $3.00 a share its shareholders who own fewer than 100 shares of common stock as of July 18.</p>
<p>The company said it has 1,200 record name shareholders with less than 100 shares. These record name owners owners own about 13,000 shares, and it is estimated that an about equal number of &quot;odd-lot&quot; shares are held in &quot;street name.&quot;</p>
<p>The company said the offer will result in considerable savings.</p>
</text>
